  "compiler_notes": [
    "Inner join may produce multiple rows per evidence_id when both science- based and government-policy benchmarks apply to the same query. The benchmark_scoring stage downstream is responsible for applying the §4.4 precedence rule (use government_policy only when all four conditions hold). That logic deliberately lives in the LLM stage's prompt, not in this join, because applying it requires reading the evidence text — not a structural operation."
